#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.rst:2
msgid "flowing.plugins package"
msgstr "flowing.plugins package"

#: flowing.plugins:1 of
msgid "``flowing.plugins`` —— 扩展层包：``Plugin`` 统一基类与内置扩展。"
msgstr "``flowing.plugins`` —— the interface layer package: the unified ``Plugin`` base class and the builtin plugins."

#: flowing.plugins:4 flowing.plugins.Plugin:4 flowing.plugins.Plugin.install:5
#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.shutdown:5 of
msgid "功能介绍"
msgstr "Overview"

#: flowing.plugins:5 of
msgid "本包承载 Flowing 三层架构的内置扩展层，包含两部分："
msgstr "This package hosts the builtin plugin layer of Flowing's three-tier architecture, and contains two parts:"

#: flowing.plugins:7 of
msgid ":class:`Plugin` —— 所有扩展（含内置）的统一基类，唯一定义点； 扩展作者继承本类并实现 ``install`` 即可接入框架。"
msgstr ":class:`Plugin` —— the unified base class for all plugins (including builtin ones), the single definition point; plugin authors subclass it and implement ``install`` to hook into the framework."

#: flowing.plugins:9 of
msgid ""
"随包发布、需显式启用的内置扩展，各自是一个独立子包： :mod:`flowing.plugins.skills` （``SkillPlugin``"
" / ``use_skill``）、 :mod:`flowing.plugins.comm` （``CommPlugin`` / "
"``use_comm``）、 :mod:`flowing.plugins.cron` （``CronPlugin`` / "
"``use_cron``）、 :mod:`flowing.plugins.workflow` （``WorkflowPlugin`` / "
"``Workflow``）、 :mod:`flowing.plugins.clipboard` （``ClipboardPlugin`` / "
"``use_clipboard``）。"
msgstr ""
"The builtin plugins shipped with the package, each an independent subpackage that must be enabled explicitly: :mod:`flowing.plugins.skills` (``SkillPlugin``"
" / ``use_skill``), :mod:`flowing.plugins.comm` (``CommPlugin`` / "
"``use_comm``), :mod:`flowing.plugins.cron` (``CronPlugin`` / "
"``use_cron``), :mod:`flowing.plugins.workflow` (``WorkflowPlugin`` / "
"``Workflow``), :mod:`flowing.plugins.clipboard` (``ClipboardPlugin`` / "
"``use_clipboard``)."

#: flowing.plugins:16 of
msgid ""
"启用遵循双层启用模型。阶段一调用 ``runtime.install(plugin)`` 安装全局能力 （工具、``provide`` "
"值、配置命名空间、Agent 类型、Resource、全局状态命名 空间）；阶段二各 Agent 在 ``setup()`` 中调用 "
"``use_xxx(self)`` 做实例级 启用。框架核心发布时不预装任何内置扩展；未启用的扩展对 Agent 而言 "
"从没存在过（零开销，不是被跳过）。``Plugin`` 基类定义在扩展包而非 ``flowing.runtime``：核心只经 "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install` 消费 插件接口，不认识任何具体插件。"
msgstr ""
"Enabling follows a two-tier enablement model. Phase one calls ``runtime.install(plugin)`` to install global capabilities (tools, ``provide`` "
"values, config namespaces, agent types, Resources, global state namespaces); in phase two each agent calls "
"``use_xxx(self)`` inside ``setup()`` for instance-level enablement. The framework core ships with no builtin plugins preinstalled; a plugin that is not enabled simply never exists for an agent "
"(zero overhead, not skipped). The ``Plugin`` base class is defined in the plugin package rather than in ``flowing.runtime``: the core consumes "
"the plugin interface only through :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install` and knows no concrete plugin."

#: flowing.plugins:25 of
msgid "全局约定（跨符号、影响使用的约定）"
msgstr "Global Conventions (cross-symbol conventions that affect usage)"

#: flowing.plugins:26 of
msgid ""
"生命周期：框架对插件实例只回调两个方法——安装时的 :meth:`Plugin.install` 与关闭时的 "
":meth:`Plugin.shutdown`。其余运行期 协作走 ``provide`` / ``inject`` "
"与消息队列，框架不主动调用插件的其它方法。"
msgstr ""
"Lifecycle: the framework calls back only two methods on a plugin instance — :meth:`Plugin.install` at install time and "
":meth:`Plugin.shutdown` at shutdown time. All other runtime cooperation goes through ``provide`` / ``inject`` "
"and the message queue; the framework does not proactively call any other plugin method."

#: flowing.plugins:29 of
msgid ""
"声明式依赖：插件在 ``dependencies`` 中声明依赖的其它插件注册名， 只声明、不自己检查。每次 ``install()`` "
"安装后，框架对已装插件集合做 增量校验：依赖缺失只发 ``warnings.warn`` 警告、不抛错；依赖成环抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.DependencyError` （报错现场即引入环的那次 ``install()``）。"
msgstr ""
"Declarative dependencies: a plugin declares the registered names of the plugins it depends on in ``dependencies`` — declare only, never check by itself. After each ``install()`` "
"call, the framework performs an incremental validation of the installed plugin set: a missing dependency only triggers a ``warnings.warn`` warning, no error is raised; a dependency cycle raises "
":class:`flowing.errors.DependencyError` (the error site is the very ``install()`` call that introduced the cycle)."

#: flowing.plugins:34 of
msgid ""
"插件约定（consenting adults，靠自觉遵守而非框架校验）：``install`` "
"只注册——不做业务、不查询其它插件、不修改其它状态；协作不查询—— 插件间经 ``provide`` / ``inject`` "
"或消息队列协作，安装顺序与协作 结果无关；注册只在 ``install``——运行时不增删全局注册状态；依赖只 声明——不自己检查依赖是否满足。"
msgstr ""
"Plugin conventions (consenting adults — honored by self-discipline rather than enforced by the framework): ``install`` "
"only registers — no business logic, no querying other plugins, no modifying other state; cooperation without querying — plugins cooperate via ``provide`` / ``inject`` "
"or the message queue, and the result is independent of install order; registration happens only in ``install`` — global registration state is never added or removed at runtime; dependencies are only declared — a plugin never checks by itself whether its dependencies are satisfied."

#: flowing.plugins:39 of
msgid ""
"绑函数约定（检查后跳过）：插件或 Composable 向 Agent 或 Runtime 实例绑定函数成员（如 ``use_skill`` 绑定"
" ``agent.skill_load``、 ``SkillPlugin.install`` 绑定 "
"``runtime.register_skill``）时，仅当 对象当前没有该成员才绑定（``hasattr`` 检查，含类级方法）——开发者 "
"可能已自定义同名逻辑，绑定方不得覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"Function-binding convention (check then skip): when a plugin or composable binds a function member onto an agent or runtime instance (e.g. ``use_skill`` binds"
" ``agent.skill_load``, ``SkillPlugin.install`` binds "
"``runtime.register_skill``), it binds only when the object does not already have that member (``hasattr`` check, including class-level methods) — the developer "
"may already have customized logic under the same name, and the binder must not overwrite it."

#: flowing.plugins:44 of
msgid ""
"命名约定（习惯约定，非强制校验）：插件注册名取「类名去掉 ``Plugin`` 后缀再转 kebab-case」（``CronPlugin`` →"
" ``\"cron\"``、``SkillPlugin`` → ``\"skill\"``）；插件绑到 Agent 的成员以注册名的 "
"underscore 版为前缀 （``skill_load``、``comm_handler``），前缀即命名空间，因此不提供 改名参数。"
msgstr ""
"Naming conventions (customary, not enforced): a plugin's registered name is \"the class name with the ``Plugin`` suffix removed, converted to kebab-case\" (``CronPlugin`` →"
" ``\"cron\"``, ``SkillPlugin`` → ``\"skill\"``); members a plugin binds onto an agent are prefixed with the underscore version of the registered name "
"(``skill_load``, ``comm_handler``). The prefix itself is the namespace, so no renaming parameter is provided."

#: flowing.plugins:49 of
msgid ""
"注册名是 per-Runtime 作用域的标签，不是全局唯一标识：生态上不排斥 两个作用相近的插件取同一个注册名；约束只有一条——每个 "
"Runtime 同时 只装一个同名插件，重复安装同名插件时 ``install()`` 抛 ``ValueError``。"
msgstr ""
"A registered name is a per-runtime scoped label, not a globally unique identifier: the ecosystem does not frown upon two plugins with similar purposes sharing one registered name; there is only one constraint — each "
"runtime installs at most one plugin under a given name at a time, and reinstalling a same-named plugin makes ``install()`` raise ``ValueError``."

#: flowing.plugins:52 of
msgid ""
"同名 ``provide`` key 重复注册是覆盖更新（后者生效，``inject`` 实时 "
"可见），框架不报错；避免插件间键冲突靠键名前缀约定（插件注册名加 ``:`` 前缀）。"
msgstr ""
"Re-registering the same ``provide`` key is an overwrite update (the latter takes effect and is visible to ``inject`` "
"immediately); the framework does not raise an error. Avoiding key collisions between plugins relies on the key-prefix convention (the plugin's registered name plus a ``:`` prefix)."

#: flowing.plugins:55 of
msgid ""
"插件 ``install`` 抛出的异常从 ``Runtime.install()`` 直接上抛，框架不按插件粒度 "
"隔离降级：安装失败的插件不会进入已装集合。"
msgstr ""
"Exceptions raised by a plugin's ``install`` propagate directly out of ``Runtime.install()``; the framework does not "
"isolate or degrade on a per-plugin basis: a plugin whose installation fails never enters the installed set."

#: flowing.plugins:59 flowing.plugins.Plugin:16
#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.install:19 of
msgid "使用示例"
msgstr "Examples"

#: flowing.plugins:79 of
msgid ""
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install` （阶段一入口）、 "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.shutdown` （插件收尾阶段）、 "
":class:`flowing.plugins.Plugin`、各内置扩展子包"
msgstr ""
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install` (the phase-one entry point), "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.shutdown` (the plugin teardown phase), "
":class:`flowing.plugins.Plugin`, and the individual builtin plugin subpackages"

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin:1 of
msgid "扩展（插件）统一基类——内置扩展与用户扩展的共同接口。"
msgstr "Unified base class for plugins — the common interface of builtin plugins and user plugins."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin:5 of
msgid ""
"阶段一（Runtime 安装）的契约载体：``runtime.install(plugin)`` 按实参顺序 对每个插件实例调用一次 "
":meth:`install`，插件在此注册全局能力（工具、 ``provide`` 值、配置命名空间、Agent "
"类型、Resource、全局状态命名空间）。 插件实例由用户代码构造后传入 ``Runtime.install()``，框架不实例化插件。 "
"本类是扩展的唯一基类；子类须显式声明 :attr:`name` 与 :attr:`dependencies` （:attr:`namespace`"
" 可选），并按需实现 :meth:`install` / :meth:`shutdown`。插件作者的约定（``install`` "
"只注册、协作不查询、注册只在 ``install``、依赖只声明；以及绑函数 约定、命名约定）见本模块 docstring「全局约定」。"
msgstr ""
"The contract carrier of phase one (runtime installation): ``runtime.install(plugin)`` calls "
":meth:`install` once on each plugin instance in argument order, where the plugin registers global capabilities (tools, ``provide`` values, config namespaces, agent "
"types, Resources, global state namespaces). Plugin instances are constructed by user code and passed into ``Runtime.install()``; the framework does not instantiate plugins. "
"This class is the sole base class for plugins; subclasses must explicitly declare :attr:`name` and :attr:`dependencies` (:attr:`namespace`"
" is optional), and implement :meth:`install` / :meth:`shutdown` as needed. The conventions for plugin authors (``install`` "
"only registers, cooperation without querying, registration only in ``install``, dependencies only declared; plus the function-binding and naming conventions) are documented in the \"Global Conventions\" section of this module's docstring."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin:36 flowing.plugins.Plugin.install:28
#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.shutdown:11 of
msgid "行为要点"
msgstr "Key Behaviors"

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin:37 of
msgid ""
"``runtime.install()`` 按实参顺序对每个插件调用一次 ``install``；可分批 调用，依赖正确性由每次 "
"``install()`` 后的增量校验保障（与安装顺序 无关）；同名插件重复安装抛 ``ValueError`` （一个 Runtime "
"同时只装 一个同名插件）。"
msgstr ""
"``runtime.install()`` calls ``install`` once on each plugin in argument order; calls may be batched, and dependency correctness is guaranteed by the incremental validation after each "
"``install()`` (independent of install order); reinstalling a same-named plugin raises ``ValueError`` (a runtime "
"installs at most one plugin under a given name at a time)."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin:41 of
msgid ""
"生命周期：插件实例在 ``install`` 之后只被框架回调一次—— :meth:`shutdown`；其余运行期协作走 ``provide``"
" / ``inject`` 与 消息队列，框架不主动调用插件的其它方法。"
msgstr ""
"Lifecycle: after ``install``, the framework calls back a plugin instance only once — :meth:`shutdown`; all other runtime cooperation goes through ``provide``"
" / ``inject`` and the message queue, and the framework does not proactively call any other plugin method."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin:44 of
msgid ""
"推荐在创建任何 Agent（``mount`` / ``create_agent`` / ``recover_agent``）之前完成全部 "
"``install()``。框架不校验调用时机： 迟装不报错，但已创建的 Agent 不会获得迟装插件注册的能力；插件 未安装时，对应 "
"``use_xxx()`` 的第一步 ``inject`` 抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`。"
msgstr ""
"It is recommended to complete all "
"``install()`` calls before creating any agent (``mount`` / ``create_agent`` / ``recover_agent``). The framework does not validate call timing: late installation raises no error, but agents already created will not gain the capabilities registered by late-installed plugins; when a plugin is not installed, the first ``inject`` step of the corresponding "
"``use_xxx()`` raises "
":class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin:49 of
msgid ""
"``install`` 的可反复执行性：每次进程启动都会重新执行 ``install()`` → ``install()`` （每个 "
"Runtime 内每个插件只安装一次），``install`` 应写成对持久化状态结构上无关——不读取持久值做注册决策；需要从 "
"持久值派生运行时结构的重建，放在 ``after_recover`` （agent 侧） 或插件自择时机的懒重建（全局侧）。"
msgstr ""
"Re-executability of ``install``: every process start re-runs ``install()`` → ``install()`` (each plugin is installed only once per "
"runtime), so ``install`` should be written to be structurally independent of persisted state — never read persisted values to make registration decisions; reconstruction of runtime structures derived from "
"persisted values belongs in ``after_recover`` (agent side) or in a lazy rebuild at a time of the plugin's own choosing (global side)."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin:54 of
msgid ""
"边缘情况：``dependencies`` 中的名字无对应已安装插件 → ``install()`` 时 ``warnings.warn`` "
"警告、不抛错；已装插件依赖图成环 → ``install()`` 抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.DependencyError`。"
msgstr ""
"Edge cases: a name in ``dependencies`` has no corresponding installed plugin → ``install()`` emits a ``warnings.warn`` "
"warning and does not raise; the dependency graph of installed plugins forms a cycle → ``install()`` raises "
":class:`flowing.errors.DependencyError`."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin:58 of
msgid ""
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install`、 "
":class:`flowing.plugins.skills.SkillPlugin` 等内置实现"
msgstr ""
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install`, and builtin implementations such as "
":class:`flowing.plugins.skills.SkillPlugin`"

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.name:1 of
msgid ""
"插件注册名。子类必须显式声明：框架不提供默认值、不自动派生 （``Runtime.install`` 直接按本名登记，未声明即 "
"``AttributeError``）。 推荐格式（习惯约定，非强制校验）：类名去掉 ``Plugin`` 后缀转 kebab-"
"case（``CronPlugin`` → ``\"cron\"``）。"
msgstr ""
"The plugin's registered name. Subclasses must declare it explicitly: the framework provides no default and does not derive one automatically (``Runtime.install`` registers directly under this name; if undeclared, "
"``AttributeError``). Recommended format (customary, not enforced): class name with the ``Plugin`` suffix removed, converted to kebab-"
"case (``CronPlugin`` → ``\"cron\"``)."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.name:6 of
msgid ""
"本名用于：``dependencies`` 的依赖匹配（其它插件按注册名声明依赖）、 ``runtime.get_plugin(name)`` "
"查询、日志、快照 ``plugins`` 列表， 以及同名插件查重——一个 Runtime 同时只装一个同名插件。注册名是 per-Runtime"
" 作用域的标签，生态语义见模块 docstring「全局约定」。"
msgstr ""
"This name is used for: dependency matching in ``dependencies`` (other plugins declare dependencies by registered name), ``runtime.get_plugin(name)`` "
"lookups, logging, the snapshot ``plugins`` list, and same-name plugin dedup — a runtime installs at most one plugin under a given name at a time. A registered name is a per-runtime "
"scoped label; see the \"Global Conventions\" section of the module docstring for its ecosystem semantics."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.name:11 of
msgid ":attr:`namespace`"
msgstr ":attr:`namespace`"

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.namespace:1 of
msgid ""
"插件命名空间（建议非强制，框架不读取）。供插件自身资源的键名 前缀约定：provide key、配置命名空间等以 "
"``\"myplugin:xxx\"`` 形态加 前缀，避免跨插件冲突；插件对外显示的名称（如注册的工具名）保持 干净（不带前缀）。"
msgstr ""
"The plugin namespace (recommended, not enforced; the framework never reads it). A key-prefixing convention for the plugin's own resources: provide keys, config namespaces, etc. are prefixed in the "
"``\"myplugin:xxx\"`` form to avoid cross-plugin collisions; names the plugin shows externally (such as registered tool names) stay clean (no prefix)."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.dependencies:1 of
msgid ""
"声明式依赖清单：其它插件的注册名（``name``）列表。依赖只声明 约定：插件只声明、不自己检查；框架在每次 ``install()`` "
"后对已装插件 集合做增量校验——清单中的名字无对应已安装插件时只发 ``warnings.warn`` 警告、不抛错；已装插件依赖图成环时抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.DependencyError` （报错现场即引入环的那次 ``install()``）。"
msgstr ""
"Declarative dependency list: a list of registered names (``name``) of other plugins. The declare-only convention: a plugin declares but never checks by itself; after each ``install()`` "
"the framework performs an incremental validation of the installed plugin set — when a name in the list has no corresponding installed plugin it only emits a ``warnings.warn`` warning, no error is raised; when the dependency graph of installed plugins forms a cycle it raises "
":class:`flowing.errors.DependencyError` (the error site is the very ``install()`` call that introduced the cycle)."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.dependencies:8 of
msgid ":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install` —— 依赖校验在该 方法内执行。"
msgstr ":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install` —— dependency validation is performed inside this method."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.plugin_dir:1 of
msgid ""
"插件自身所在目录：插件类定义所在文件的上级目录。插件随身携带 资源文件（``.fya`` 工具 / 子 Agent 定义 / 模板等）时的路径基准"
" ——这些文件不在项目 ``@/`` （指向 flowing 子项目目录的路径 前缀）下、也不在任何 Agent 的 ``source_dir``"
" 链（该 Agent 解析声明式资源的源目录）上，只能以本属性拼路径传给 ``runtime.register_tool()`` "
"（文件路径形态）："
msgstr ""
"The directory the plugin itself lives in: the parent directory of the file where the plugin class is defined. The path base for resource files the plugin carries with it (``.fya`` tools / sub-agent definitions / templates, etc.)"
" — these files live neither under the project ``@/`` (the path prefix pointing at the flowing subproject directory) nor on any agent's ``source_dir``"
" chain (the source directories where that agent resolves declarative resources), so their paths can only be built from this attribute and passed to ``runtime.register_tool()`` "
"(in file-path form):"

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.plugin_dir:16 of
msgid "只读属性，无副作用。"
msgstr "Read-only property with no side effects."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.install:1 of
msgid "阶段一入口：向 Runtime 注册全局能力。基类空实现，实现类按需 选用注册通道。"
msgstr "Phase-one entry point: registers global capabilities with the runtime. The base class is an empty implementation; implementing classes pick the registration channels they need."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.install:6 of
msgid ""
"可用注册通道（全部按需可选）：``runtime.register_tool()`` （收已 "
"构造的工具实例或工具定义文件路径——随身携带的资源文件以 :attr:`plugin_dir` 拼路径并显式给 ``namespace``）、 "
"``runtime.provide()``、``runtime.register_config_namespace()``、 "
"``runtime.register_agent_type()``、``runtime.register_resource()``、 "
"``runtime.register_state()`` （开启全局状态命名空间，创建即重放 "
"持久值；何时读取持久值派生运行时结构由插件自己管理）。观测面 没有注册通道——插件状态经插件自己的只读 API 暴露（如 cron 扩展 经 "
"``runtime.inject(cron_scheduler_key)`` 取调度器后调用 ``jobs()``）；per-agent 状态键在"
" ``setup()`` 中经 ``agent.state.register()`` 登记，不在本阶段。"
msgstr ""
"Available registration channels (all optional, use as needed): ``runtime.register_tool()`` (accepts an already-"
"constructed tool instance or the path of a tool definition file — build the path of carried resource files from :attr:`plugin_dir` and pass ``namespace`` explicitly), "
"``runtime.provide()``, ``runtime.register_config_namespace()``, "
"``runtime.register_agent_type()``, ``runtime.register_resource()``, "
"``runtime.register_state()`` (opens a global state namespace, replaying persisted values upon creation; when to read persisted values to derive runtime structures is managed by the plugin itself). The observation surface "
"has no registration channel — plugin state is exposed through the plugin's own read-only API (e.g. the cron plugin "
"gets the scheduler via ``runtime.inject(cron_scheduler_key)`` and then calls ``jobs()``); per-agent state keys are registered via ``agent.state.register()`` "
"in ``setup()``, not in this phase."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.install:29 of
msgid ""
"``runtime.install()`` 按实参顺序对每个插件调用一次本方法；本方法 抛出的异常从 ``runtime.install()`` "
"直接上抛（框架不隔离），安装失败的 插件不会进入已装集合。"
msgstr ""
"``runtime.install()`` calls this method once on each plugin in argument order; exceptions raised by this method propagate directly out of ``runtime.install()`` "
"(the framework does not isolate them), and a plugin whose installation fails never enters the installed set."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.install:32 of
msgid "只注册——不做业务、不查询其它插件、不修改其它状态；注册只在 本方法发生，运行时不增删全局注册状态。"
msgstr "Register only — no business logic, no querying other plugins, no modifying other state; registration happens only in this method, and global registration state is never added or removed at runtime."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.install:34 of
msgid "同 key 重复 ``provide`` 是覆盖更新（后者生效），框架不报错。"
msgstr "Re-``provide``-ing the same key is an overwrite update (the latter takes effect); the framework does not raise an error."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.install:35 of
msgid ""
"返回 ``None``。运行期协作走 ``provide`` / ``inject`` 与消息 队列，插件不在本方法保存 runtime "
"引用用于运行期回调。"
msgstr ""
"Returns ``None``. Runtime cooperation goes through ``provide`` / ``inject`` and the message queue; a plugin does not keep a runtime "
"reference from this method for runtime callbacks."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.install:38 of
msgid "当前安装的 Runtime 实例。"
msgstr "The runtime instance currently being installed into."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr "Return type"

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.install:40 of
msgid ""
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install`、 "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.provide`"
msgstr ""
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install`, "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.provide`"

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.shutdown:1 of
msgid "收尾入口：Runtime 优雅关闭时框架对每个插件调用一次。基类默认 no-op，实现类覆写。"
msgstr "Teardown entry point: the framework calls this once on each plugin when the runtime shuts down gracefully. The base class is a no-op by default; implementing classes override it."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.shutdown:6 of
msgid ""
"谁 ``install`` 谁收尾：插件显式管理自己的收尾逻辑（停定时器、 关闭总线、释放运行期资源）。本方法是 ``install`` "
"之后框架唯一 回调插件实例的方法。"
msgstr ""
"Whoever installs, tears down: a plugin explicitly manages its own teardown logic (stop timers, close buses, release runtime resources). This method is the only one the framework "
"calls back on a plugin instance after ``install``."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.shutdown:12 of
msgid ""
"时机：``Runtime.shutdown()`` 的插件收尾阶段——晚于所有 Agent 的递归 "
"destroy，早于全局状态视图关闭与退出事件置位（此时 ``await runtime`` 尚未解除阻塞）；按 ``install()`` 的 "
"install 顺序逐个 ``await``。"
msgstr ""
"Timing: the plugin teardown phase of ``Runtime.shutdown()`` — after the recursive destroy of all agents, "
"before the global state views are closed and the exit event is set (at which point ``await runtime`` has not yet been unblocked); each plugin is ``await``-ed one by one in the "
"install order of ``install()``."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.shutdown:16 of
msgid "单插件异常不阻断后续收尾：框架记日志后继续（尽力收尾路径）。"
msgstr "An exception from one plugin does not block the remaining teardown: the framework logs it and continues (a best-effort teardown path)."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.shutdown:17 of
msgid "不删除持久化数据：session 目录与全局状态文件随目录存续，本 方法只释放运行期资源。"
msgstr "No persisted data is deleted: session directories and global state files persist with their directories; this method only releases runtime resources."

#: flowing.plugins.Plugin.shutdown:20 of
msgid ":meth:`install` （阶段一对称端）、 :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.shutdown`"
msgstr ":meth:`install` (the phase-one counterpart), :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.shutdown`"

